{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_009_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f435f79d45fb121d4f2b3c59b7f3b6a63d411b729de489ed768ad74b2ff7cbe1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abd8afe8899e9a0d1fd4e19d6980c3362697e3759e0928fa8ee581f30bd7ef5",
      "text": "从事务所回家的路上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:466981acb0840f5eba1b2022327c52053f55671224b56ab69895e9079f6a22a2",
      "text": "（瞄了一眼会议室里面，\n那些装饰全都是皮埃尔和实先生做的吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26d0df2ac418fa4988589ec2f5f3d70baad18c01e8c4816579a81caeb9785fcd",
      "text": "（他们俩工作应该也很忙才对，\n却特意为了我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b34bf2ba608cb7274f04e22824fb96012c7806d534d1044627cc308ca8cb137",
      "text": "（这么一想，总觉得心里不太踏实。\n有种莫名坐立不安的感觉）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e580705408ce3653146da96c87a207c5a463f9a6944a337f4c3f8d22578527a",
      "text": "（……离生日还有几天来着，之类的。\n明明以前从来没在意过这种事）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35654de1f32b963722064b2a6e17996ccd3e94869fa6170626e7fc3d292b3969",
      "text": "（总觉得，这种感觉也挺让人开心的啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73ef8b867ab9794d5adf6471c24b26a7ae3b8c5c46b47ac6580fb363e1c9b7b2",
      "text": "（……我能做到的，\n可不只是满怀期待地等待当天而已吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0724a39187f5d10257e7860e1746d91fa9995bdd3bf20f5d014c19b9a4c27112",
      "text": "（为了能够尽情享受派对，\n我也要把自己的工作好好干好才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a656b7d2b2fb7d281eb4d23b4b57083477a17f3bcc69b50b84ec60e6070f6812",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_02_1_2_009_02:1_2_009_02_d:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4d37640d4df1365a12550dc7787436a14732eedb9b9bb13ac1cf0403bf6408f",
      "text": "（游戏……就留到下一个休息日吧，\n今晚吃完饭早点睡觉好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
